1. **Independent Project**:
   PulsarNav is an independent, non-commercial, open-source interoperability tool developed for motorcycle owners to bridge Google Maps turn-by-turn navigation data to digital instrument clusters over Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE).

2. **No Affiliation**:
   This project and its contributors are NOT affiliated with, authorized by, sponsored by, or in any way officially connected with **Bajaj Auto Limited**, **OTC Engineering**, **Google LLC**, or any of their subsidiaries or affiliates.

