   - "Google", "Google Maps", and the Google Maps navigation chevron are registered trademarks of Google LLC.
   - Any use of these marks within this project is strictly for descriptive nominative fair use to indicate device interoperability and compatibility under applicable law (including Indian Copyright Act § 52(1)(ab), U.S. DMCA § 1201(f), and EU Directive 2009/24/EC).

4. **Clean-Room Protocol Implementation**:
   This software does not incorporate, bundle, or redistribute any proprietary code, proprietary binary firmware, or trade secrets belonging to Bajaj Auto Ltd or OTC Engineering. All packet formatting and GATT characteristics were implemented independently through clean-room interoperability research of standard Bluetooth telematics frames.
